                        "review": "It's a brutally fun side scrolling space shooter with one of the coolest mechanics I've seen in the genre.\nYou play as a psychic being lost in space, and instead of piloting one single ship, you can possess and take control of pretty much anything you come across. Jumping from ship to ship mid-chaos, using their unique weapons and abilities against the rest of the fleet, feels fresh and incredibly satisfying.\n\n\n",
